  "body": "This release has brings features from previous versions of kallisto that were missing when the new index structure was created\r\n\r\nThis includes\r\n- pseudobam creation, recording pseudoalignment on a transcript/target level to bam files\r\n- genomebam creation, same as above, but projected to genome coordinates\r\n- fusion, generating output necessary for working with pizzly \r\n\r\n\r\n",
